Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 00:34:25 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1226/1252] HERESY 1169: the lyrics box as a code editor: its
 lines numbered, Alt+K marks a line and Alt+J goes to the next mark, every tag
 under a thin amber layer; the Writer's lyrics too
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Viktor 08.10.2026: «В редактор лирики можно как в кодовом редакторе отображение номера строки? И вообще… по Alt+K маркировать строки, а по Alt+J прыгать на них. И подсвечивать тонким альфа слоем все музыкальные теги». HeresyLyrics.aids(area): the numbers in the box's left padding, the tags' boxes and the marked lines' bands read from a copy of its layout; marks follow their lines as text is added or taken above them, kept with the text's signature (a reload brings them back). Alt+Shift+J goes to the mark before, Alt+Shift+K clears them; the meter's bar says how many and switches the numbers.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 tools/console/app.css          |  12 +++
 tools/console/app.js           |   1 +
 tools/console/heresy-lyrics.js | 134 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 3 files changed, 145 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/tools/console/app.css b/tools/console/app.css
index 6e83664..7199594 100644
--- a/tools/console/app.css
+++ b/tools/console/app.css
@@ -4424,3 +4424,15 @@ body[data-frame] :is(#view-compose, #view-take) { scrollbar-gutter: stable; }
 .tr-voice-opts { display: inline-flex; gap: 4px; }
 .tr-voice .tr-chip { padding: 2px 9px; }
 .tr-voice .tr-chip.is-on { border-color: var(--amber); color: var(--amber); }
+/* HERESY 1169 (Viktor 08.10.2026: «как в кодовом редакторе отображение номера строки… по Alt+K маркировать строки, а по Alt+J
+   прыгать на них. И подсвечивать тонким альфа слоем все музыкальные теги»): the lines' numbers in the box's left padding, a
+   marked line's number amber with a dot and a faint band along the line; the [tags] under a thin amber layer */
+#lyrics.lyr-numbered, #wrLyrics.lyr-numbered { padding-left: 40px; }
+.lyr-nums, .lyr-tagsl { position: absolute; overflow: hidden; pointer-events: none; }
+.lyr-num { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: flex-end; padding-right: 2px;
+  font: 10.5px/1 var(--mono); color: var(--dim); opacity: .8; }
+.lyr-num.is-mark { color: var(--amber); opacity: 1; font-weight: 700; }
+.lyr-num.is-mark::before { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 4px; top: 50%; width: 6px; height: 6px; margin-top: -3px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--amber); }
+.lyr-tagsl > .lyr-tag { position: absolute; border-radius: 2px; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--amber) 15%, transparent); }
+.lyr-tagsl > .lyr-band { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--amber) 7%, transparent); box-shadow: inset 2px 0 0 var(--amber); }
+.lyr-tog.lyr-marks { color: var(--amber); }
diff --git a/tools/console/app.js b/tools/console/app.js
